1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,190
(Howard:)Oh, before I forget,

2
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:04,080
(Howard:)tomorrow morning, you're
driving me to the dentist.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,030
(Bernadette:)I have to take you?

4
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:09,330
(Howard:)You don't have to take me.
You get to take me.

5
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:12,390
(Bernadette:)Wait a minute.
Are you telling me

6
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,810
(Bernadette:)your mother usually takes you
to the dentist?

7
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:16,370
(Howard:)It's not weird.

8
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:19,110
(Howard:)There's lots of kids there
with their moms.

9
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:22,310
(Bernadette:)I can't believe this.

10
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,980
(Howard:)What? It's fun.

11
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,250
(Howard:)If I have no cavities,

12
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:27,520
(Howard:)afterwards,
we go out for a treat.

13
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,720
(Bernadette:)All right, Howard, let's get
something straight right now.

14
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,660
(Bernadette:)I'm not going
to be your mother.

15
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:34,990
(Howard:)Whoa, whoa, whoa!

16
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:37,060
(Howard:)Where did that come from?

17
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,400
Who's that?!

18
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:49,870
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Is it a
sex criminal?!

19
00:00:49,870 --> 00:00:53,540
(Howard:)Nobody wants to do
that to you, Ma!

20
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,780
Where were you?!

21
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,210
Didn't you read my email?!

